        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Air Lituanica, AirBaltic\n- Places: Vilnius, Lithuania\n- Products: Vilnius Airport, Riga International Airport, Tallinn Airport\n\nFacts:\n- Air Lituanica was a Lithuanian airline headquartered in Vilnius and based at Vilnius Airport.\n- Air Lituanica ceased operations in 2015.\n- Vilnius Airport is the international airport of Vilnius, the capital of Lithuania.\n- Vilnius Airport has the IATA code VNO and the ICAO code EYVI.\n- AirBaltic has its main hub at Riga International Airport.\n- AirBaltic has additional bases at Tallinn Airport and Vilnius Airport.",
